Scope of this notice

The copyright above covers the original work in this repository: its
source code, its tests, and its documentation.

It does not cover, and no ownership is claimed over, the hydraulic laws,
formulas, constants and other facts those documents state, nor the
sources the model is compiled from. Those belong to their respective
authors and publishers, and each one is named where it is used — in
`src/hydraulics/references.ts` and `docs/MODEL.md`, with its title,
publisher and, where it is openly online, its URL.

What is claimed for the model is the credit for compiling it from
published sources, not ownership of that material.
